      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, it\u0027s just that using a variant is going to involve typing \"Error\" at least twice, maybe even five times: `Error::SecretkeeperError(error::SecretkeeperError::SerializationError)`\n\nThere\u0027s a [Clippy lint](https://rust-lang.github.io/rust-clippy/rust-1.75.0/index.html#/enum_variant_names) for this, but I guess it\u0027s not enabled.\n\nNot necessarily worth changing, but worth bearing in mind for the future -- `Error::Secretkeeper(error::SecretkeeperError::Serialization)` is shorter and just as clear.",
      "parentUuid": "2228e111_b01cfbb0",
      "revId": "5a5c248188da858ee33ea841db0890a69f6b81e5",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
